WEBVTT

01:47.300 --> 01:51.940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:52.060 --> 01:54.980
[Episode 16]
[This story is purely fictional]

02:04.590 --> 02:05.180
Master Zhang,

02:06.230 --> 02:08.540
who did you come here to find?

02:09.150 --> 02:11.170
An old friend named Wu Laogou.

02:11.800 --> 02:12.500
Do you know him?

02:13.960 --> 02:15.540
You don't know Wu Laogou,

02:15.870 --> 02:17.780
the Fifth Master of the Mystic Nine?

02:18.430 --> 02:20.340
Who is Wu Laogou?

02:21.520 --> 02:22.450
Is he so important

02:23.910 --> 02:24.980
that you had to bring the army?

02:26.120 --> 02:26.780
My friend,

02:27.520 --> 02:29.780
you've asked the right man.

02:30.470 --> 02:31.570
Of everyone in the Mystic Nine,

02:31.750 --> 02:33.980
I'm closest to Laogou.

02:35.590 --> 02:36.380
When it comes to his past,

02:37.030 --> 02:38.570
only I can tell the tale.

02:43.910 --> 02:45.260
He may not compare to Master Zhang,

02:45.800 --> 02:46.980
but he's a legend in his own right.

02:47.910 --> 02:49.100
To understand who he is,

02:49.430 --> 02:52.220
we must begin with how he joined the Mystic Nine.

03:04.250 --> 03:05.460
Move it!

03:05.460 --> 03:06.920
[Xiangyuan Mine]
- Hurry up! - You fool!

03:07.470 --> 03:09.290
Laogou was sold into the mines as a boy,

03:09.710 --> 03:11.500
where he lived a life worse than death.

03:26.310 --> 03:26.850
Move!

03:27.630 --> 03:28.410
Put your back into it!

03:29.630 --> 03:30.220
Hurry!

03:30.240 --> 03:30.940
Stop dawdling!

03:32.400 --> 03:33.010
Move!

03:34.120 --> 03:34.610
Hurry!

03:35.360 --> 03:35.850
Go.

03:41.400 --> 03:42.290
Hurry!

03:42.400 --> 03:43.100
Catch it.

03:43.470 --> 03:44.450
Stop slacking! Move!

03:45.910 --> 03:46.500
Move faster!

03:47.590 --> 03:48.260
Hurry!

03:48.400 --> 03:49.100
- Come on! - Move!

03:49.590 --> 03:50.170
Did you hear me?

03:51.960 --> 03:52.890
- Go! - Hurry!

03:52.910 --> 03:54.340
Why are you so slow?

03:54.520 --> 03:55.850
Move! Get over there!

04:00.710 --> 04:02.060
Hurry!

04:02.360 --> 04:03.220
Stop dawdling! Move!

04:03.960 --> 04:04.890
Hurry!

04:05.080 --> 04:05.780
Move!

04:06.960 --> 04:07.540
Hurry!

04:09.910 --> 04:10.610
You in the back, move.

04:16.110 --> 04:16.920
What are you staring at?

04:17.160 --> 04:18.020
What are you doing?

04:18.480 --> 04:19.050
Leave him!

04:19.830 --> 04:20.780
- Don't mind him! - Move!

04:20.950 --> 04:21.610
Eat your food!

04:21.680 --> 04:22.780
- Keep the line moving!
- Get back to work when you're done!

04:24.070 --> 04:24.660
Eat faster!

04:24.720 --> 04:25.460
Stop dawdling!

04:25.480 --> 04:26.140
I'm talking to you!

04:26.250 --> 04:27.140
Worthless wretch.

04:28.040 --> 04:29.140
Why are you dawdling? Hurry!

04:29.240 --> 04:29.900
Eat faster!

04:31.120 --> 04:31.660
Hurry up and eat!

04:31.870 --> 04:33.020
Master Zhang later rescued him.

04:33.070 --> 04:33.810
Get back to work when you're done!

04:33.870 --> 04:35.700
From then on, he placed his faith in the Mystic Nine,

04:36.070 --> 04:36.870
- hoping they would
- Thank you, Master Zhang.

04:36.870 --> 04:38.660
- uphold justice.
- Thank you for saving us.

04:39.840 --> 04:40.980
Thank you, Master Zhang.

04:43.040 --> 04:44.050
Zhang Qishan.

04:45.510 --> 04:47.020
Master Zhang of the Mystic Nine.

04:50.070 --> 04:50.730
Stop dawdling.

04:51.240 --> 04:52.730
Move! Slacking off, are you?

04:57.000 --> 04:59.340
But not everyone was as fortunate as Laogou.

05:11.360 --> 05:12.290
See?

05:12.680 --> 05:13.610
Remember this, all of you.

05:15.310 --> 05:18.610
This is what happens to shirkers and malingerers!

05:20.310 --> 05:22.170
People only learn the hard way.

05:23.270 --> 05:25.540
A beating stays with them longer than a meal!

05:31.630 --> 05:32.170
Halt.

05:33.340 --> 05:35.510
[Zhang's Residence]

05:35.510 --> 05:36.140
What do you want?

05:36.480 --> 05:37.100
My friend,

05:38.630 --> 05:40.020
this is the Zhang residence, right?

05:40.830 --> 05:41.780
I'm here to see Master Zhang.

05:41.950 --> 05:44.460
The Changsha Defense Commander doesn't meet just anyone.

05:44.630 --> 05:45.410
No, my friend.

05:46.120 --> 05:47.850
I have an extremely urgent matter for him.

05:48.680 --> 05:49.220
Please,

05:49.600 --> 05:50.540
tell him I'm here.

05:51.000 --> 05:51.810
Then you can wait.

05:54.870 --> 05:55.700
For how long?

05:56.830 --> 05:58.460
At least a few months.

05:58.680 --> 05:59.460
A few months?

06:02.430 --> 06:03.810
Out! Ninth Master isn't here!

06:03.920 --> 06:04.540
Out! Go!

06:05.160 --> 06:06.220
Ninth Master isn't in Changsha.

06:06.310 --> 06:07.980
Come back when he returns.

06:08.160 --> 06:08.850
Now leave!

06:12.940 --> 06:14.740
[Xie's Residence]

06:19.140 --> 06:22.660
[Pear Garden]

06:24.740 --> 06:26.100
[Pear Garden]

06:28.830 --> 06:37.930
♪The Monkey King, born of nature, takes countless forms♪

06:38.630 --> 06:42.340
♪He steals pills and wine♪

06:42.560 --> 06:46.930
- Bravo! - Bravo!

06:51.190 --> 07:01.170
♪For throwing the Peach Banquet into chaos♪

07:01.310 --> 07:10.540
♪He's hunted by 100,000 heavenly troops♪

07:11.360 --> 07:15.900
- Bravo! - Bravo!

07:23.630 --> 07:24.290
What are you doing?

07:26.240 --> 07:27.700
I'm here to see Second Master Hong.

07:28.270 --> 07:29.170
I urgently need his help.

07:29.630 --> 07:30.980
Many people want to see him.

07:31.680 --> 07:32.490
Who are you?

07:32.950 --> 07:36.610
Second Master doesn't see just anyone.

07:36.920 --> 07:37.370
Out!

07:37.480 --> 07:38.220
My friend, I...

07:38.310 --> 07:38.780
Get out!

07:39.600 --> 07:41.660
Back then, Laogou went from door to door seeking help.

07:42.070 --> 07:44.220
He sought out both Ninth Master and Second Master,

07:44.600 --> 07:47.810
hoping to join the Mystic Nine and meet Master Zhang.

07:50.720 --> 07:51.660
But he was

07:52.310 --> 07:53.930
only a young lad

07:54.390 --> 07:55.660
with neither status nor influence.

07:56.070 --> 07:58.490
How could he possibly meet Master Zhang?

07:58.750 --> 07:59.250
Tiezui.

08:03.360 --> 08:04.850
My friend, how was my story?

08:05.360 --> 08:06.170
Very good.

08:07.240 --> 08:08.810
I'll tell you the rest next time.

08:09.310 --> 08:09.900
Next time, then.

08:10.920 --> 08:11.340
Let's go.

08:42.000 --> 08:43.130
Stay alert, everyone.

08:44.960 --> 08:46.730
We're about to enter Mount Heimen.

08:47.750 --> 08:48.700
From this moment on,

08:49.600 --> 08:50.420
tread lightly.

08:51.150 --> 08:52.530
By local custom,

08:53.550 --> 08:57.060
no one entering Mount Heimen may disturb the mountain deity.

08:57.360 --> 08:58.130
Yes.

09:04.260 --> 09:12.140
[Mount Heimen]

09:26.200 --> 09:26.850
Master Zhang,

09:27.150 --> 09:28.370
the feng shui here is ominous.

09:29.480 --> 09:30.370
Everyone, be careful!

09:31.030 --> 09:32.530
We're entering the mountain deity's domain.

09:39.840 --> 09:40.300
Master Zhang.

09:42.440 --> 09:43.130
There's something ahead.

09:59.480 --> 10:00.010
Stay alert!

10:03.000 --> 10:03.460
Master Zhang,

10:04.720 --> 10:06.370
I saw that Nuo mask in the stockade.

10:07.360 --> 10:08.100
That hunter

10:09.440 --> 10:10.530
seems to be from Heimao Stockade.

10:13.320 --> 10:14.770
Lower the body first.

10:44.480 --> 10:45.490
His brains have been sucked dry.

10:47.870 --> 10:48.890
Tiezui, what do you make of it?

10:51.960 --> 10:53.180
The "Classic of the Northern Interior of the Realm" says:

10:53.840 --> 10:55.220
"The Taoquan resembles a dog.

10:55.630 --> 10:57.850
Blue-green, it eats people starting from the head.

10:58.750 --> 10:59.850
Qiongqi resembles a tiger.

11:00.120 --> 11:02.180
Winged, it eats people starting from the head.

11:02.840 --> 11:03.850
Its victims' hair hangs loose.

11:04.720 --> 11:06.340
Another account says it eats them starting from the feet."

11:07.870 --> 11:08.370
Master Zhang,

11:08.790 --> 11:10.220
the classic says

11:10.670 --> 11:12.250
both the Taoquan and Qiongqi

11:12.670 --> 11:14.530
eat people starting from the head.

11:16.150 --> 11:16.770
What do you mean?

11:17.510 --> 11:19.980
Are you saying I ate him?

11:20.670 --> 11:22.130
That's not what I meant.

11:23.790 --> 11:26.180
Maybe a Taoquan ate him.

11:27.510 --> 11:28.100
And

11:28.390 --> 11:29.890
"Strange Tales" records a creature

11:31.240 --> 11:33.180
shaped like a wild dog

11:33.790 --> 11:35.250
that feeds solely on human brains.

12:00.120 --> 12:01.340
The body was dragged

12:02.440 --> 12:04.340
all the way here from up there.

12:05.120 --> 12:05.650
Master Zhang.

12:09.600 --> 12:10.130
Master Zhang,

12:10.670 --> 12:13.100
judging by these violent drag marks,

12:14.480 --> 12:16.250
this creature must be immensely strong.

12:16.720 --> 12:17.770
The mountain deity did this!

12:18.150 --> 12:19.060
It must be nearby!

12:21.870 --> 12:22.370
Tell me,

12:23.080 --> 12:24.220
have you ever seen the mountain deity?

12:26.510 --> 12:27.770
I've never seen it.

12:28.000 --> 12:29.770
But the stories I heard as a child said

12:31.840 --> 12:33.650
the mountain deity eats people's brains.

12:33.960 --> 12:34.650
All right, enough.

12:34.910 --> 12:35.820
Stop talking nonsense.

12:36.270 --> 12:37.220
With so many of us here,

12:37.390 --> 12:38.420
even a tiger would be afraid.

12:38.910 --> 12:39.420
Besides,

12:40.150 --> 12:41.820
Master Zhang is here.

12:42.270 --> 12:43.460
What creature would dare come near?

12:44.080 --> 12:44.730
Nonsense.

12:45.390 --> 12:46.370
You have a point.

12:48.270 --> 12:48.940
Then let's do this.

12:49.240 --> 12:50.300
We'll change our approach.

12:50.670 --> 12:52.820
Xiaoyu, let Tiezui walk alone

12:53.240 --> 12:53.820
as bait.

12:54.270 --> 12:55.130
We'll follow him.

12:56.440 --> 12:57.610
Master Zhang,

12:57.840 --> 12:59.770
you aren't gambling with my life, are you?

13:01.360 --> 13:03.250
Put what we brought on him.

13:03.960 --> 13:04.300
Yes.

13:04.320 --> 13:05.100
What is it?

13:05.480 --> 13:06.580
The Zhang Clan's secret weapon.

13:07.150 --> 13:08.340
You're going to love it.

13:08.790 --> 13:09.490
Master Zhang,

13:09.750 --> 13:12.250
my plain clothes are perfectly fine.

13:12.440 --> 13:13.420
There's no need to put me in...

13:13.440 --> 13:14.770
Don't worry. I'm here.

13:15.120 --> 13:16.650
That's not the point, Master Zhang...

13:16.670 --> 13:17.650
Can't you divine the future?

13:18.550 --> 13:19.370
Work it out yourself.

13:22.030 --> 13:23.460
Right. You have a point.

13:24.000 --> 13:24.460
Master Zhang,

13:25.750 --> 13:26.490
this infant...

13:27.150 --> 13:28.300
He hardly ever cries.

13:29.360 --> 13:30.460
He'll grow up to be extraordinary.

13:31.240 --> 13:31.940
Keep him safe.

13:32.750 --> 13:33.730
Have everyone get ready.

13:34.480 --> 13:34.940
Yes.

13:56.910 --> 13:58.940
I've checked the whole area.

13:59.790 --> 14:02.250
Many of the leaves are covered in this slime.

14:04.870 --> 14:05.610
That means

14:06.030 --> 14:08.180
the mountain deity often prowls around here.

14:08.750 --> 14:10.850
It usually appears at night.

14:13.480 --> 14:14.940
We cannot kill it.

14:15.510 --> 14:16.730
We can only take you this far.

14:17.670 --> 14:18.300
Strangers,

14:19.480 --> 14:20.490
good luck.

14:41.600 --> 14:42.100
Tiezui.

14:42.630 --> 14:43.250
Everything's ready.

14:57.910 --> 14:58.490
Master Zhang.

15:01.750 --> 15:02.370
Master Zhang?

15:03.720 --> 15:04.890
Are you there?

15:05.440 --> 15:07.300
If you are, say something.

15:15.510 --> 15:16.610
Is anyone there?

15:16.840 --> 15:18.300
This isn't funny.

15:18.790 --> 15:20.220
I could get killed.

15:21.240 --> 15:22.220
If you're there,

15:23.080 --> 15:23.940
throw a pebble

15:25.120 --> 15:26.130
or make a sound.

15:33.320 --> 15:34.420
Adjutant Xiaoyu?

15:40.390 --> 15:40.980
Master Zhang?

15:41.910 --> 15:44.340
I'm my family's only heir.

15:44.440 --> 15:46.490
You can't let me die here.

15:50.440 --> 15:51.010
Master...

16:16.270 --> 16:17.370
Adjutant Xiaoyu,

16:18.270 --> 16:19.100
is that you?

16:50.270 --> 16:51.490
Master Zhang!

16:52.150 --> 16:54.130
I knew you wouldn't leave me here alone.

17:14.000 --> 17:15.140
What is this?

17:15.590 --> 17:16.460
Human skin?

17:16.880 --> 17:18.530
It was torn from that monster.

17:19.720 --> 17:20.250
Master Zhang.

17:22.960 --> 17:24.700
We failed to stop it at the perimeter.

17:25.310 --> 17:27.490
The monster got away.

17:28.400 --> 17:28.980
Master Zhang,

17:29.590 --> 17:31.900
could that monster be the mountain deity?

17:33.720 --> 17:34.420
Probably not.

17:34.640 --> 17:36.010
We made inquiries in Heimao Stockade.

17:36.480 --> 17:38.810
Legend says the mountain deity there

17:39.440 --> 17:41.570
is enormous, as large as an elephant.

17:41.830 --> 17:43.700
But the creature we saw

17:44.720 --> 17:46.460
was only about as tall as a man.

17:46.830 --> 17:49.460
But this skin reeks.

17:49.960 --> 17:51.490
It smells like a giant salamander.

17:52.200 --> 17:54.050
It has a human form, yet smells like a giant salamander?

17:54.590 --> 17:55.770
How could something like this

17:55.960 --> 17:57.180
exist deep in the mountains?

17:59.550 --> 18:00.050
Master Zhang,

18:01.270 --> 18:02.330
do you think there might be

18:02.350 --> 18:03.860
a tribe of strange humanoids living here?

18:04.110 --> 18:05.090
We have too few clues.

18:05.310 --> 18:06.140
Don't make wild guesses.

18:06.750 --> 18:08.810
Everyone, stay on high alert.

18:09.960 --> 18:11.700
The situation here is more complicated than I expected.

18:12.240 --> 18:14.250
We'll camp here tonight.

18:14.720 --> 18:15.250
Adjutant.

18:20.550 --> 18:21.090
Adjutant!

18:23.110 --> 18:23.810
Where's Stinky Yu?

18:24.270 --> 18:25.330
Everyone, follow me!

18:25.590 --> 18:26.180
Yes, sir!

18:28.720 --> 18:29.290
Master Zhang!

18:30.070 --> 18:30.700
Master Zhang!

18:32.350 --> 18:32.810
You're

18:33.640 --> 18:34.980
leaving me behind again?

19:12.070 --> 19:12.700
Everyone,

19:13.350 --> 19:13.900
follow me.

19:53.240 --> 19:54.180
Someone's coming after us.

20:16.480 --> 20:18.570
Is that the mountain deity?

20:21.880 --> 20:22.860
Our mission

20:24.200 --> 20:25.330
is to kill the Japanese.

20:57.400 --> 20:58.420
Good heavens.

20:59.510 --> 21:00.700
A tooth this big?

21:04.550 --> 21:05.090
That's not right.

22:07.160 --> 22:07.770
Adjutant Zhang?

22:10.200 --> 22:10.770
Adjutant Zhang?

22:20.750 --> 22:21.420
Adjutant Zhang.

22:21.920 --> 22:22.530
Adjutant Zhang!

22:23.110 --> 22:23.810
Adjutant Zhang!

22:25.110 --> 22:27.090
Master Zhang, we found something.

22:29.640 --> 22:30.620
Master Zhang, look.

22:39.070 --> 22:39.490
Move.

23:27.680 --> 23:28.250
Master Zhang,

23:29.720 --> 23:30.570
Xiaoyu...

23:58.790 --> 23:59.290
Master Zhang?

24:00.160 --> 24:01.380
He must have been resting below

24:02.160 --> 24:03.220
and got dragged all the way up here.

24:04.110 --> 24:06.730
Was it the monster from earlier?

24:11.000 --> 24:11.530
No.

24:12.550 --> 24:15.050
It was another one, much larger.

24:24.920 --> 24:26.220
It went back the way we came.

24:29.510 --> 24:30.090
Tiezui.

24:33.550 --> 24:34.050
Eighth Master!

24:34.590 --> 24:35.140
Eighth Master!

24:35.680 --> 24:36.220
Eighth Master.

24:37.200 --> 24:38.980
- Eighth Master. - Eighth Master.

24:40.030 --> 24:40.570
Eighth Master.

24:40.680 --> 24:43.730
- Eighth Master! - Eighth Master!

24:52.640 --> 24:54.460
What is he laughing at?

25:10.480 --> 25:10.940
Master Zhang,

25:11.880 --> 25:14.090
what is that thing?

25:22.920 --> 25:23.570
Master Zhang!

25:24.640 --> 25:26.460
I... I'm Xiaoyu!

25:28.030 --> 25:30.810
Don't shoot!

25:31.790 --> 25:33.460
It really is the mountain deity!

25:35.200 --> 25:37.250
Don't shoot!

25:37.310 --> 25:37.810
After it!

25:37.880 --> 25:38.730
Don't act rashly!

25:39.550 --> 25:40.380
Master Zhang, Xiaoyu...

25:40.440 --> 25:41.660
It has Xiaoyu.

25:42.790 --> 25:43.940
We'll only get one chance.

25:52.070 --> 25:53.730
Take the others to find Eighth Master.

25:53.960 --> 25:54.250
Yes.

25:54.440 --> 25:55.140
Yancheng, Yantao,

25:55.310 --> 25:56.530
Zhang Xiaoli, Zhang Xiaoping,

25:56.720 --> 25:57.940
load your weapons and follow me.

25:58.440 --> 25:59.050
Yes.

26:02.480 --> 26:03.980
Spread out. Find Eighth Master, quickly.

26:04.110 --> 26:04.620
Yes.

26:06.160 --> 26:07.050
- Eighth Master. - Eighth Master.

26:07.480 --> 26:07.980
Eighth Master!

26:08.550 --> 26:09.490
- Eighth Master. - Eighth Master.

26:09.590 --> 26:10.090
Xiaojin.

26:12.240 --> 26:12.900
Eighth Master!

26:13.240 --> 26:14.010
Xiaojin!

26:16.640 --> 26:17.330
Xiaojin!

26:17.590 --> 26:18.180
Eighth Master?

26:18.830 --> 26:19.940
Is that you, Xiaojin?

26:19.960 --> 26:20.490
Eighth Master.

26:22.440 --> 26:23.860
I'm so scared, Xiaojin!

26:25.030 --> 26:25.690
What are you doing here?

26:25.690 --> 26:27.010
Xiaojin, that was so scary.

26:27.240 --> 26:29.700
There was a monster just now, with feet this big.

26:29.750 --> 26:31.250
Look, this is one of its teeth.

26:31.510 --> 26:32.250
I nearly died of fright.

26:37.240 --> 26:39.140
Eighth Master, we should go.

26:39.310 --> 26:39.860
Something's wrong.

26:40.310 --> 26:41.050
What happened?

26:41.270 --> 26:42.090
Adjutant Xiaoyu

26:43.350 --> 26:44.250
was taken by a monster.

27:18.510 --> 27:23.010
Help me restore worship of the mountain deity,

27:24.000 --> 27:26.660
and I'll have someone from the stockade bring a baby

27:27.000 --> 27:28.530
into the mountains with you.

27:32.680 --> 27:33.220
This way.

27:52.310 --> 27:53.180
There's a trap ahead.

28:05.030 --> 28:06.250
Something is definitely wrong here.

28:08.200 --> 28:09.460
If that thing appears,

28:09.880 --> 28:10.620
I'll handle it.

28:11.880 --> 28:12.810
You rescue the adjutant.

28:14.880 --> 28:16.090
If we really run into danger,

28:18.510 --> 28:19.700
hide the baby somewhere safe.

28:19.720 --> 28:20.140
Yes.

28:39.110 --> 28:39.620
Wait.

28:40.510 --> 28:41.290
What is it, Eighth Master?

28:41.720 --> 28:42.660
Something is wrong here.

28:46.000 --> 28:46.730
But Eighth Master,

28:47.310 --> 28:49.090
we need to rejoin Master Zhang at once.

28:55.120 --> 28:55.920
Eighth Master!

28:55.920 --> 28:56.570
Adjutant Xiaojin,

28:57.750 --> 28:59.010
we should listen to Eighth Master.

29:04.960 --> 29:05.420
Eighth Master.

29:06.160 --> 29:08.860
This terrain forms a Coiled Dragon Pillar formation.

29:10.200 --> 29:13.140
The surrounding ridges resemble a dragon with its head pointing down.

29:14.110 --> 29:16.490
In feng shui, this is called a Condemned Dragon.

29:17.550 --> 29:18.140
Look.

29:18.790 --> 29:20.570
That forest is so heavily shrouded in mist

29:21.240 --> 29:22.730
because it forms a maze

29:23.110 --> 29:24.730
that has trapped the dragon here.

29:26.400 --> 29:29.420
There must be something here.

29:30.750 --> 29:32.530
Eighth Master, if something is here,

29:32.680 --> 29:33.700
perhaps we should withdraw first.

29:33.920 --> 29:35.490
No. Give me more time.

29:50.240 --> 29:50.770
Eighth Master!

29:50.960 --> 29:52.180
- Eighth Master! - Eighth Master.

30:08.830 --> 30:09.770
Where are my glasses?

30:10.790 --> 30:11.250
Eighth Master.

30:13.200 --> 30:13.770
Are you all right?

30:14.110 --> 30:14.940
I'm fine.

30:17.110 --> 30:17.940
Here, get up.

30:18.550 --> 30:20.050
My poor backside...

30:33.070 --> 30:35.490
Where are we?

31:02.880 --> 31:04.460
Eighth Master, look.

31:25.200 --> 31:26.180
There's a cliff here.

31:26.640 --> 31:27.290
Watch your step.

31:44.030 --> 31:44.730
This thing

31:45.440 --> 31:46.490
looks ancient.

31:47.400 --> 31:47.940
Eighth Master,

31:48.480 --> 31:49.900
do you know what dynasty it's from?

31:50.510 --> 31:53.330
This chest appears to be made of rosewood.

31:57.510 --> 31:58.770
It dates to around the Han dynasty.

31:59.110 --> 32:00.490
It's remarkably well preserved.

32:01.400 --> 32:02.730
It must have been sealed with wax

32:02.920 --> 32:04.250
to protect it from decay and damp.

32:05.070 --> 32:07.420
But such rosewood chests

32:07.750 --> 32:09.730
came only as tribute from the southeastern tribes

32:09.830 --> 32:10.860
and were found among imperial gifts.

32:13.200 --> 32:15.860
Why was this one abandoned here?

32:16.590 --> 32:17.620
If you don't know,

32:18.110 --> 32:19.090
we certainly won't.

32:22.350 --> 32:23.290
I've never seen

32:23.880 --> 32:24.700
this kind of vine either.

32:25.270 --> 32:25.980
Have you?

32:26.440 --> 32:27.570
Never one this strange.

32:32.750 --> 32:33.330
Look here.

32:35.200 --> 32:36.620
These holes in the chest

32:37.830 --> 32:40.250
seem to have been deliberately designed

32:40.830 --> 32:41.860
to leave space

32:42.640 --> 32:44.860
for the vines to grow from within.

32:48.510 --> 32:49.620
So it's a potted plant?

32:53.480 --> 32:55.770
It's a magical artifact chest, for goodness' sake.

32:56.350 --> 32:57.460
- This one? - Never mind.

32:58.240 --> 32:59.220
The ancients placed it here

32:59.590 --> 33:00.380
to practice magic

33:00.400 --> 33:02.810
and cultivate immortality.

33:04.160 --> 33:05.620
A chest this precious

33:06.680 --> 33:08.940
must contain a rare magical artifact.

33:09.310 --> 33:09.770
Come on.

33:11.270 --> 33:12.050
Open it.

33:12.480 --> 33:14.660
Eighth Master, it may be dangerous.

33:16.680 --> 33:18.220
Are we listening to you or me?

33:19.550 --> 33:20.090
Open it.

34:06.750 --> 34:08.050
What did you just do?

34:08.510 --> 34:10.260
It's a unique smoke technique of the Zhang Clan.

34:10.710 --> 34:11.690
If the smoke is drawn inside,

34:12.150 --> 34:13.610
it means there's a vast temperature difference within.

34:17.510 --> 34:18.980
If this is a coffin,

34:20.280 --> 34:21.210
whatever is inside

34:22.480 --> 34:23.420
must be a demon.

34:45.920 --> 34:46.380
One.

34:46.880 --> 34:47.380
Two.

34:47.840 --> 34:48.300
Three.

35:04.710 --> 35:07.530
Why is there a jar inside the artifact chest?

35:08.710 --> 35:09.530
Look around it.

35:10.440 --> 35:11.980
Those aren't ordinary tusks.

35:12.840 --> 35:14.530
They're ancient tusks fossilized into dragon bone.

35:17.920 --> 35:18.460
Eighth Master,

35:19.360 --> 35:20.900
there seems to be something in the jar.

35:22.590 --> 35:23.380
Here. Take this.

35:28.800 --> 35:30.090
It looks like a monkey.

35:30.150 --> 35:30.650
A monkey?

35:33.550 --> 35:34.650
Strange.

35:35.800 --> 35:37.980
Why does its skin look so aged?

35:38.920 --> 35:39.650
Could this be

35:42.030 --> 35:43.820
the Lifeswapping Herb?

35:44.670 --> 35:45.380
Lifeswapping Herb?

35:47.280 --> 35:48.610
Ancient Xiangxi had a dark ritual:

35:48.960 --> 35:50.570
a newborn animal

35:50.960 --> 35:52.570
would be submerged in a jar of special liquid.

35:53.030 --> 35:54.980
The corpse water from the jar

35:55.670 --> 35:56.740
would then be used to nourish this plant

35:57.110 --> 35:58.650
called the Lifeswapping Herb.

35:59.070 --> 36:01.900
Legend says it can even transfer lifespans.

36:02.670 --> 36:03.460
How?

36:04.190 --> 36:06.690
I suppose it drains the animal's lifespan

36:07.150 --> 36:08.940
into itself.

36:09.320 --> 36:10.460
Then the herb

36:11.190 --> 36:13.340
is transplanted into another person's body.

36:14.320 --> 36:15.130
No wonder

36:16.510 --> 36:19.090
the monkey's skin looks so aged.

36:19.590 --> 36:22.130
But what does the Lifeswapping Herb

36:23.030 --> 36:23.980
have to do with the mountain deity?

36:24.760 --> 36:25.860
How would I know?

36:26.360 --> 36:27.460
This is dark magic.

36:29.480 --> 36:30.420
To find out,

36:30.960 --> 36:31.980
we'll have to take the jar out.

36:32.150 --> 36:32.690
Take it out!

36:36.110 --> 36:37.420
Is that all right, Eighth Master?

37:06.960 --> 37:10.380
What if I fed this to Zhang Qishan?

37:13.070 --> 37:15.050
Perhaps then he'd do as I say.

37:22.360 --> 37:24.090
I wonder how they're doing.

37:25.710 --> 37:26.860
Other than Xiangu,

37:27.920 --> 37:29.860
no one else in the Mystic Nine will come for me, will they?

37:55.710 --> 37:56.170
Look.

37:57.190 --> 37:58.130
This monster

37:58.280 --> 38:00.380
resembles the one we just encountered.

38:08.150 --> 38:08.980
I remember now.

38:09.710 --> 38:10.900
There's an old Xiangxi legend

38:11.440 --> 38:13.900
about a local creature,

38:14.360 --> 38:15.380
half human and half fish,

38:15.510 --> 38:17.490
that dwells underground and feeds on people.

38:18.710 --> 38:21.690
The locals called it Zhainiangniang.

38:22.440 --> 38:23.490
This is it.

38:23.630 --> 38:24.610
This is a Zhainiangniang?

38:26.190 --> 38:28.050
Why is it dragging a chest?

38:30.880 --> 38:31.490
Look.

38:32.360 --> 38:33.900
This forest is littered with bones.

38:34.590 --> 38:37.170
That means the forest is poisonous.

38:38.000 --> 38:38.940
People can't enter it,

38:39.360 --> 38:40.690
but a Zhainiangniang can.

38:41.510 --> 38:43.980
They must've hidden inside such a chest

38:44.550 --> 38:45.980
and had a Zhainiangniang drag them in.

38:46.440 --> 38:48.740
Does hiding in the chest keep out the poison?

38:51.800 --> 38:53.490
According to the mural,

38:54.440 --> 38:56.380
after eating the Lifeswapping Herb,

38:57.070 --> 38:58.300
a person can withstand the poison,

38:58.880 --> 38:59.490
but

38:59.840 --> 39:01.700
they will age rapidly.

39:06.000 --> 39:06.900
That's

39:07.880 --> 39:11.300
how the legend of transferring lifespans arose.

39:12.590 --> 39:14.130
People cultivated the Lifeswapping Herb

39:14.570 --> 39:16.150
so they could enter this forest.

39:17.880 --> 39:18.780
But why did they

39:18.800 --> 39:19.780
want to enter it?

39:20.440 --> 39:23.980
What's hidden in this forest?

39:39.000 --> 39:39.530
Look.

39:40.230 --> 39:41.740
Isn't that the little golden jar

39:41.760 --> 39:43.010
Stinky Yu mentioned?

39:43.190 --> 39:44.460
The one Ding Qiansui spat out.

39:44.760 --> 39:46.530
So this is what they used

39:47.030 --> 39:48.490
to regain their youth.

39:51.620 --> 39:53.980
[Xumi Realm, Otherworld Cave]

39:56.840 --> 39:58.090
Otherworld Cave?

40:00.320 --> 40:02.260
Xumi Realm, Otherworld Cave?

40:03.920 --> 40:05.490
All the believers who entered the tower

40:06.150 --> 40:07.490
wanted to reach a place

40:08.070 --> 40:09.210
called the Xumi Realm.

40:11.510 --> 40:12.460
This cave

40:13.360 --> 40:15.860
must be where the Otherworld Patriarch attained the Way.

40:18.760 --> 40:19.570
I understand now.

40:20.920 --> 40:22.900
The underground river beneath the Otherworld Tower

40:23.000 --> 40:24.650
leads directly to the Otherworld Cave in Xiangxi.

40:26.000 --> 40:27.490
The Otherworld Cave is the Xumi Realm,

40:27.650 --> 40:29.260
an earthly paradise.

40:30.710 --> 40:31.570
Then the Xumi Realm

40:32.880 --> 40:34.130
must be in Xiangxi.

41:50.840 --> 41:52.300
Enough!

42:03.590 --> 42:04.420
Put him down.

42:04.760 --> 42:07.050
Why have you trespassed on my domain?

42:08.960 --> 42:10.050
Are you the mountain deity?

42:13.710 --> 42:14.570
Do you eat people?

42:15.400 --> 42:16.090
I...

42:17.030 --> 42:18.520
I need to eat...

42:18.570 --> 42:20.010
If you eat people, you die.

42:20.920 --> 42:22.690
I don't want to die.

42:25.320 --> 42:26.690
Even a deity fears death?

42:27.800 --> 42:29.210
You killed so many of my men.

42:30.760 --> 42:32.300
You don't get a choice today!

43:42.280 --> 43:43.380
So you, too, are mortal.

43:56.000 --> 43:57.690
KGX?

44:02.700 --> 44:05.700
[KGX-02-03]

44:06.510 --> 44:08.340
One of Yoshiyuki Hatoyama's test subjects.

44:26.030 --> 44:26.740
Laogou.

44:31.840 --> 44:32.690
Master Zhang!

44:34.230 --> 44:34.940
Master Zhang.

44:37.590 --> 44:38.260
Master Zhang,

44:38.360 --> 44:40.260
the mountain deity punished us.

44:40.800 --> 44:42.650
They're all dead.

44:48.440 --> 44:49.170
Give me the binoculars.

44:53.960 --> 44:54.460
Oh, no.

44:57.000 --> 44:57.820
The Xumi Realm

44:58.360 --> 45:00.170
must be inside that miasma-filled forest.

45:05.880 --> 45:09.240
Legend says Mount Heimen is impassable because a mountain deity

45:09.590 --> 45:10.650
dwells there.

45:11.800 --> 45:14.650
But now it seems the deity isn't the reason.

45:15.150 --> 45:17.650
It's the highly poisonous miasma on Mount Heimen.

45:18.070 --> 45:18.740
Exactly.

45:21.000 --> 45:21.860
In that case,

45:22.840 --> 45:23.690
we can't enter either.

45:27.280 --> 45:28.170
I have an idea.

45:28.400 --> 45:29.050
Go on, Eighth Master.

45:29.400 --> 45:31.300
We can use that monster.

45:34.400 --> 45:37.050
But Master Zhang has probably already...

45:45.030 --> 45:45.940
There's a smaller one.

45:46.510 --> 45:47.780
It can't drag the chest, can it?

45:48.230 --> 45:49.820
Do we have to wait for it to grow?

45:52.550 --> 45:53.340
Master Zhang!

45:53.510 --> 45:53.940
Eighth Master!

45:54.360 --> 45:55.900
Master Zhang, keep it alive!

45:56.030 --> 45:56.690
Slow down, Eighth Master!

46:03.630 --> 46:05.610
- Master Zhang, keep it alive!
- Eighth Master.

46:05.800 --> 46:06.420
Don't kill it!

46:09.320 --> 46:09.820
Master Zhang!

46:10.800 --> 46:12.090
Master Zhang, are you all right?

46:12.400 --> 46:13.530
How did you get hurt so badly?

46:14.150 --> 46:15.050
- Are you all right? - Master Zhang.

46:15.880 --> 46:16.460
Stinky Yu!

46:16.760 --> 46:19.090
Stinky Yu! Is he all right, Master Zhang?

46:20.150 --> 46:21.170
He'll be fine.

46:23.880 --> 46:24.340
Xiaojin.

46:24.630 --> 46:25.050
Yes.

46:28.200 --> 46:29.400
Get our men down.

46:50.740 --> 46:55.020
♪The prophecy once foretold♪

46:55.900 --> 46:57.580
♪Is slowly coming true♪

46:58.700 --> 47:02.340
♪Ask those who've joined♪

47:03.180 --> 47:05.620
♪Is it a curse or a blessing?♪

47:06.060 --> 47:09.780
♪The past fades like smoke♪

47:10.620 --> 47:12.340
♪Yet the heart cannot let go♪

47:13.380 --> 47:16.060
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

47:17.060 --> 47:20.540
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

47:20.820 --> 47:23.780
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

47:24.740 --> 47:27.580
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

47:28.220 --> 47:29.460
♪But this could be♪

47:29.740 --> 47:35.140
♪Our last trip together♪

47:35.500 --> 47:38.780
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

47:39.220 --> 47:42.620
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

47:42.940 --> 47:46.660
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

47:46.860 --> 47:50.100
♪Who believes in fate?♪

47:50.300 --> 47:53.300
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

47:54.060 --> 47:57.500
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

47:57.740 --> 48:01.500
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

48:01.500 --> 48:05.620
♪Take care♪

48:10.070 --> 48:10.570
Salute!

48:36.740 --> 48:40.900
♪The past fades like smoke♪

48:41.260 --> 48:43.980
♪A choice is made in silence♪

48:44.260 --> 48:47.060
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

48:47.460 --> 48:51.220
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

48:51.460 --> 48:54.900
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

48:55.180 --> 48:58.580
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

48:58.660 --> 49:05.940
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

49:06.380 --> 49:09.660
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

49:09.940 --> 49:13.180
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

49:13.340 --> 49:17.380
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

49:17.580 --> 49:20.940
♪Who believes in fate?♪

49:21.180 --> 49:24.540
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

49:24.780 --> 49:28.060
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

49:28.380 --> 49:32.060
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

49:32.260 --> 49:35.500
♪Take care♪

49:35.500 --> 49:38.060
♪We once raced♪

49:38.140 --> 49:40.060
♪For the dawn♪

49:40.220 --> 49:43.500
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

49:43.620 --> 49:46.900
♪In the web of fate♪

49:46.900 --> 49:50.100
♪No one can escape♪

49:51.100 --> 49:52.940
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

49:53.100 --> 49:54.660
♪We too were young once♪

49:54.740 --> 49:58.180
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

49:58.380 --> 50:00.700
♪Keep the ember lit♪

50:00.820 --> 50:05.340
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

50:05.460 --> 50:08.420
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

50:08.660 --> 50:12.180
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

50:12.300 --> 50:16.060
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

50:16.380 --> 50:19.860
♪Who believes in fate?♪

50:20.020 --> 50:23.020
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

50:23.260 --> 50:27.020
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

50:27.180 --> 50:30.900
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

50:31.020 --> 50:42.460
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
